SUMMARY:Archives (Archive Room and Library)
DESCRIPTION:Join the Archives small group – we meet Tuesday afternoons from 4pm to 5pm in the Archives Room on the 2nd floor of the Vincent Building. We are in the midst of a multi-year project organizing Union’s documents\, photographs\, pictures\, and more – all the while sharing conversation\, laughter and fun\, interesting\, and often inspirational facts and lessons from those who came before us.
