SUMMARY:Jewish High Holy Days (Offsite)
DESCRIPTION:Rosh Hashanah and Yom Kippur for Jews with Multi-Heritage Families: Register to join freelance Reform Rabbi Nikki DeBlosi\, PhD\, for welcoming\, inclusive\, and relaxed Rosh Hashanah (12 September) and Yom Kippur (21 September) services at Glen Ridge Congregational Church. Jews (unaffiliated with a local synagogue) and their families\, of all backgrounds\, genders\, sexualities\, Hebrew knowledge levels\, and ages are welcome. Services will be Reform-style\, musical\, and non-traditional. Please reach out to Rabbi Nikki at ravnikkid@gmail.com with questions.
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/jewish-high-holy-days-offsite/2026-09-12/
LOCATION:Glen Ridge Congregational Church\, 195 Ridgewood Ave\, Glen Ridge\, NJ\, 07028\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Events
END:VEVENT
