SUMMARY:Union Cong Music Program Kick-Off (Sanctuary and Assembly Room)
DESCRIPTION:UCC Music Program Kick-Off: Saturday\, September 12\, 11:00 AM-1:00 PM \nJoin the Sanctuary Choir and/or the UCC Ringers at our Music Program Kickoff on Saturday\, September 12! Union’s music ensembles are open to all\, regardless of musical experience or membership status. Contact John David (jwhitener@unioncong.org) or Jeremy Whitener (jeremy@unioncong.org) for more details!
