SUMMARY:Second Hour: Section Leader Recital (Sanctuary)
DESCRIPTION:2nd Hour Recital: Sunday\, September 13\, 11:30 AM–12:30 PM in the Sanctuary \nThe Union Cong Music Program is thrilled to present a special 2nd Hour recital on September 13th\, featuring section leaders Kristine Hart\, Kimberly Martinez\, and Bill Amory alongside Co-Directors of Music John David and Jeremy Whitener. The program will include a selection of art songs and opera arias\, offering the congregation an opportunity to experience and celebrate the musical gifts of our ministry leaders.
