SUMMARY:Youth Group (Guild Room and Kitchen)
DESCRIPTION:A new school year means a fresh start\, new adventures\, and a chance to reconnect! Join us as we reboot Youth Group with a fun night of sushi\, games & new friends! \nEveryone will get to make their own sushi-inspired rolls\, with non-seafood and veggie options so there’s something for everyone. Come see if you can handle Wasabi Roulette or put your chopstick skills to the test.
