SUMMARY:Women's Breakfast (Assembly Room)
DESCRIPTION:Our “Kick-Off” Women’s Breakfast on Saturday September 19th at 9:00am\, will have us traveling to India with our own Deb Williams. \nSince her first visit in 2009\, Deborah Williams has returned to India six times to travel\, study yoga\, chanting\, and philosophy\, and immerse herself in the culture. Through photographs and personal stories\, she will share some of the places\, traditions\, and experiences that continue to draw her back—and reflect on the lessons she continues to bring home. \nCome and join us for a fascinating and informative morning. \nA delicious breakfast\, with gluten-free options\, will be served. The cost will be $7.00. \nPlease RSVP to Karen Ermler\, karen.ermler@gmail.com\, so we can plan accordingly. \nGuests are always welcome. Hope to see you there!
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/womens-breakfast-assembly-room-2/
LOCATION:Assembly Room and Kitchen\, 176 Cooper Avenue\, Montclair\, 07043\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Church Events,All Events,Featured Events,Small Groups
ORGANIZER;CN="Union Congregational Event":MAILTO:contact@unioncong.org
